1. Option 0 sahi hai: 1885 ke first Congress session mein President W.C. Bonnerjee ne INC ke core objectives outline kiye the, jinme foremost aims the:
   - **National Fraternity**: Desh ke different provinces aur presidencies ke dedicated political aur social workers ke beech personal contacts aur friendly relations develop karna;
   - **National Unity**: Provincial, religious aur regional prejudices ko eradicate karke unified Indian national identity consolidate karna;
   - Major administrative matters par all-India level par common, mature public demands formulate aur document karna.
2. Option 1, Option 2, aur Option 3 fictitious, coercive aur isolated points hain jo early Congress ke objectives se completely contrary hain.
